{
  "name": "AionUi Multi-Provider Gemini Integration",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AionUi Multi-Provider Gemini Integration\n\nCe workflow démontre comment utiliser l'API AionUi avec rotation automatique des clés Gemini.\n\n### Configuration requise:\n1. Serveur AionUi démarré: `npm run server`\n2. Clés API configurées dans .env\n3. URL de base: http://localhost:25808\n\n### Providers disponibles:\n- gemini_api_key_rotative (recommandé)\n- gemini_cli (nécessite OAuth)\n- kiro_cli (à venir)",
        "height": 464.79166666666663,
        "width": 567.3958333333333
      },
      "id": "1",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "prompt",
              "value": "Écris un haiku sur l'intelligence artificielle"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2",
      "name": "Input Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        860,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://localhost:25808/api/gemini_api_key_rotative/chat",
        "authentication": "none",
        "requestMethod": "POST",
        "jsonParameters": true,
        "bodyParametersJson": "={\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"{{ $json.prompt }}\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"stream\": false,\n  \"options\": {\n    \"temperature\": 0.7,\n    \"max_tokens\": 1000\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3",
      "name": "Gemini API Chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1080,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Extraire la réponse de Gemini\nconst response = $input.item.json;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    prompt: items[0].json.prompt,\n    response: response.message.content,\n    model: response.model,\n    provider: response.provider,\n    timestamp: response.created_at\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "4",
      "name": "Format Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1300,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://localhost:25808/api/gemini_api_key_rotative/generate",
        "authentication": "none",
        "requestMethod": "POST",
        "jsonParameters": true,
        "bodyParametersJson": "={\n  \"prompt\": \"{{ $json.prompt }}\",\n  \"stream\": false,\n  \"options\": {\n    \"temperature\": 0.9\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5",
      "name": "Gemini API Generate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1080,
        580
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Extraire la réponse de génération\nconst response = $input.item.json;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    prompt: items[0].json.prompt,\n    response: response.response,\n    model: response.model,\n    provider: response.provider,\n    timestamp: response.created_at\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "6",
      "name": "Format Generate Response",
